  {
   "id": "albacete-warrior-152237@0.4.0",
   "gameId": "albacete-warrior-152237",
   "displayName": "UPDATE 0.4.0",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-07-23T16:41:34.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "What is goin' on partylovers?!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Did anyone miss us? If you were waiting for more Albacete Warrior content, and awaiting with curiosity to know how Benito's adventures continue, the wait no further. It is here.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "What's in the new update?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2 new levels.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The followup to Benito's story.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New abilities and powers unlocked with the game's progression.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "A new trailer, watchable in the store page.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New cover art, used to replace the images of both the store and user library of the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "More absurd humor.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "More cockslapping.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "More pixelated blood.: ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------: Lastly, we would like to thank everyone who has bought or played the game, and everyone who has reported a bug, left us a review, or offered us any kind of feedback.: This means the world for us, we love seeing you playing our game, and fuels our motivation to keep working hard to create things you will like, and might leave a mark in your hard, because every one of you have left one in ours.: One more time, we are asking you to leave us any kind of feedback, bug, or tell us how your quest in achieving what you want in life is going using any of our media channels. (Discord/Twitter/Youtube/e-mail) We will read it attentively",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "With a lot of love",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fas3 Studios Dev team.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
