  {
   "id": "albacete-warrior-152237@0.3",
   "gameId": "albacete-warrior-152237",
   "displayName": "UPDATE 0.3",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-06-10T16:26:22.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Quality of life changes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone, we'd like to start this announcement by thanking every single one of you for playing the game, and leaving your reviews. So far the reviews have been mostly positive, and we aim to keep them like so. We are proud and excited to be creating someone that you are all enjoying, seriously, and we will try our best to keep it like that.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have implemented some QoL changes to some parts of the game and the tutorial, with the aim of improving the games and menus clarity. If you feel these changes are not achieving this, or there is any feedback you'd like make us aware of please do let us know through our discord. Thank you for your time!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "UI and Icons",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Added \"contact us\" icons and buttons to the main menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Added use indicators to the players abilities.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Added new keyboard icons.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "• Added the current game version to the main menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Added a visual input to show the player how to use the dark benito.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Gameplay",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Dodge tutorial was modified so he player can't just move away, and the dodge is actually easy to achieve.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Modified the double jump and roll air jump tutorial layout so players get properly introduced to them.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Modified the containers a the Dojo to get a smoother climb, and avoid technical problems with the in-depth collision detection.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Dialogues",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Changed some dialogue lines that weren't too coherent.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We will continue to work on the build, and we encourage everyone to please let us know your opinion, or any problems you might've had with the game. As a reminder, we will be adding 2 more levels SoonTM, so stay tuned to our discord or twitter to not miss it!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Once again, thank you for playing,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "See you in Albacete.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sincerely",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Fas3 Studios Team.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
